#: knotify.cpp:97
msgid "KNotify"
msgstr "KNotify"

#: knotify.cpp:98
msgid "KDE Notification Server"
msgstr "KDE Inkennisstelling Bediener"

#: knotify.cpp:100
msgid "Current Maintainer"
msgstr "Huidige Instandhouer"

#: knotify.cpp:102
msgid "Sound support"
msgstr "Klank ondersteun"

#: knotify.cpp:103
msgid "Previous Maintainer"
msgstr "Vorige Instandhouer"

#: knotify.cpp:139
msgid ""
"During the previous startup, KNotify crashed while creating Arts::Dispatcher. "
"Do you want to try again or disable aRts sound output?\n"
"\n"
"If you choose to disable aRts output now, you can re-enable it later or select "
"an alternate sound player in the System Notifications control panel."
msgstr ""
"Tydens die vorige program opstart, het KNotify omgeval toe dit ARTS::Dispatcher "
"wou skep. Wil jy weer probeer om dit te skep of eerder aRts klank afvoer "
"deaktiveer?\n"
"\n"
"As jy kies om aRts afvoer te deaktiveer, kan jy dit later weer aktiveer, of 'n "
"ander klank speler kies, in die Stelsel Inkennisstelling beheer module."

#: knotify.cpp:145 knotify.cpp:184
msgid "KNotify Problem"
msgstr "KNotify Probeem"

#: knotify.cpp:146 knotify.cpp:185
msgid "&Try Again"
msgstr "Probeer Weer"

#: knotify.cpp:147 knotify.cpp:186
msgid "D&isable aRts Output"
msgstr "Deaktiveer aRts Afvoer"

#: knotify.cpp:178
msgid ""
"During the previous startup, KNotify crashed while instantiating KNotify. Do "
"you want to try again or disable aRts sound output?\n"
"\n"
"If you choose to disable aRts output now, you can re-enable it later or select "
"an alternate sound player in the System Notifications control panel."
msgstr ""
"Tydens die vorige program opstart, het KNotify tydens aktivering omgeval. Wil "
"jy weer probeer om dit te skep of eerder aRts klank afvoer deaktiveer?\n"
"\n"
"As jy kies om aRts afvoer te deaktiveer, kan jy dit later weer aktiveer, of 'n "
"ander klank speler kies, in die Stelsel Inkennisstelling beheer module."

